GDN: opt-in recurrent CUDA prefill on sm75 (VLLM_GDN_SM75=1).

Ported from weicj/vLLM-2080Ti-Definitive, commit
93c9013e375b1ecbf2da88179d2a31175a0d5c99,
tools/flashqla_sm75_patches/gdn_forward.cu (Apache-2.0).
Source: https://github.com/weicj/vLLM-2080Ti-Definitive

Use fp16 Q/K/V, 128-dimensional keys/values and fp32 recurrence accumulators.
Copy initial state before the kernel's in-place update; handle packed variable
length requests in one CUDA launch. Other geometries fall back to FLA.
Compile the extension before graph capture. Requires nvcc + a C++ compiler.

Measured 2048-token TP=2 geometry: 11.45 ms Triton vs 2.73 ms CUDA.
Output relative L2 error 0.00051; final-state relative L2 error 0.00037.

